Thursday Update
* Trade Alert: Fubo calls sold for big gain; buy Bit Digital calls* Stocks =
rebound as investors=E2=80=99 moodswings shift positive&nbsp;New data shows=
 the U.S. economy contracted at its deepest pace since World War Two in 202=
0 as the COVID-19 pandemic depressed consumer spending and business investm=
ent, pushing millions of Americans out of work and into poverty.Though a re=
covery is underway, momentum slowed significantly as the year wound down am=
id a resurgence in coronavirus infections and exhaustion of nearly $3 trill=
ion in relief money from the government, Reuters reports. The moderation is=
 likely to persist at least through the first three months of 2021.Through =
2:30 pm ET nevertheless US markets clawed back much of their Wednesday loss=
es. The Dow was up 525 points or 1.7%, the S&amp;P 500 was up 1.8%, the Nas=
daq 100 rose 1.85% and the Smallcap 600 slipped 1.6%.The economy=E2=80=99s =
prospects hinge on the distribution of vaccines to fight the virus. Preside=
nt Joe Biden has unveiled a recovery plan worth $1.9 trillion, but some law=
makers have balked at the price tag soon after the government provided near=
ly $900 billion in additional stimulus in late December.White House economi=
c advisor Brian Deese told reporters the report from the Commerce Departmen=
t on Thursday underscored the urgency for Congress to pass Biden=E2=80=99s =
plan, warning that the cost of doing nothing was too high.=E2=80=9CWithout =
swift action, we risk a continued economic crisis that will make it harder =
for Americans to return to work and get back on their feet,=E2=80=9D said D=
eese.Gross domestic product decreased 3.5% in 2020, the biggest drop since =
1946. That followed 2.2% growth in 2019 and was the first annual decline in=
 GDP since the 2007-09 Great Recession.Portfolio: Our FUBO calls were sold =
for a big overall gain of 60% yesterday, which is awesome. We came into tod=
ay flat. We now have one new idea for you. *NEW RECOMMENDATIONBit Digital I=
nc. (BTBT) February 17.5 calls-- Symbol: BTBT210219C00017500-- Order: Buy a=
t $5.70 lmt day only-- If filled, set up to sell half at $7.55 lmt gtc and =
half at $9.80 lmt gtc-- If filled, set stop at $4.00 stp, good after 10:30 =
a.m. ET only*EXITED RECOMMENDATIONfuboTV Inc. (FUBO)&nbsp;February $40 call=
s-- Symbol: FUBO210219C00040000-- Order filled at $7.10 on Monday Jan. 25.-=
- Sold half Wednesday Jan 17 at the open at $10.30 and $12.40 at second tar=
get for overall 60% gain.-- Cancel stop; this trade is complete. *Jon D. Ma=
rkmanAll recommendations are for monthly options expiring on the third Frid=
ay of the specified month unless otherwise noted. All stops are good after =
10:30 a.m. Eastern only unless otherwise specified. All orders are good for=
 the day only unless otherwise noted. "Day only" orders expire at the close=
 of the current session. Past results are no guarantee of future returns. A=
ll accounts may not achieve comparable results. Recommendations are leverag=
